# FlareWatch Worker (wrangler dev)
# Copy to `services/worker/.dev.vars` and edit.

# Optional: If your monitors use an external proxy protected by a token,
# set the same token here so the worker can send `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.
# FLAREWATCH_PROXY_TOKEN=<proxy-token>

# Required for token-free globalping:// locations. Create a token in the Globalping Dashboard.
# GLOBALPING_TOKEN=<globalping-token>
